00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.520
This is a revolutionary idea presented by the Ramban.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:11.320
Again, according to the Ramban, the court of justice of the Jewish people

00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:14.520
ceases to function with the destruction of the temple.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:19.080
In parentheses, Spinoza, in the Theological Political Treatise,

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:23.980
