00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:37.760
And therefore, Ramban says,

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:42.200
in the institution. He says what the rabbis have is not the right to legislate the Tora,

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:51.000
but to explain the Tora. It is the explanation of the Ribbi and not the right or authority

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:59.760
as a judicial body that gives them authority. Now, we have to come and see a very interesting

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:06.260
consequence of it. It is a different kind of hermeneurics, a theory of hermeneurics.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:09.600
